note irequiv fixture (issue 826): saturating byte add, two parameters (u16 domain).
note clamp_add is copied verbatim from tests/one_layer/omegese/dev/dev01.omegese
note (omega-mv 62d1d0d6). clamp_wrap is a refactor that adds in uchar and
note detects the wrap instead of widening to ushort.
fn clamp_add a uchar b uchar to uchar
x = ushort a
y = ushort b
s = add x y
if gt s 255
ret 255
end
ret uchar s
end
fn clamp_wrap a uchar b uchar to uchar
s = add a b
if lt s a
ret 255
end
ret s
end
